    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/801d2f8e-c570-4310-a31c-845779fff35e.png\" style=\"width:3.48681in;height:1.8in\" /><br />From the graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, we see that the range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;do not cut each other<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;The number of solutions is zero.",
